msgctxt "220"
msgid "Welcome!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "What can I get for you today?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "Actually, I'm not a customer. Are you one of old man Komaki's pupils?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Huh!? Wait... Are you Kazuma Kiryu?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"The master told me about you. You need to fight me to remember what you "
"learned before, is that right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"I may be working in a fast food restaurant now, but there was a time when I "
"thought I could be the very best."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"So you're the Dragon of Dojima... Even the master recognizes your legendary "
"skill."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"I'd love to get the chance to see if my Komaki techniques can stand up to "
"you! Let's take it outside!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "Boss! I'm taking my break now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "Hey! Hold on a... Dangit!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "Oh, it's you. Wanna give it another try?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid ""
"All right. I never turn down a challenger! Let's do this! Hey boss, I'm "
"taking my break now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "All right. Come back whenever. I'm always ready for a fight!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "Yeah, you're going down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "No, maybe later."
msgstr ""

